/><zone xml:id="m-a43131f9-65ea-4fb2-bf80-b50f3bb0eb0c" ulx="39" uly="737" lrx="902" lry="767" /><zone xml:id="m-0f8482fc-e7f7-482b-8825-702f67a66bf5" ulx="39" uly="763" lrx="465" lry="792" /><zone xml:id="m-1ea0afa6-adca-486d-9c0d-ba6cd8d03f0a" ulx="474" uly="765" lrx="903" lry="796" /><zone xml:id="m-654bd452-01a8-427b-bdf5-98d067997e93" ulx="472" uly="785" lrx="895" lry="821" /><zone xml:id="m-d5be4e6e-337b-449a-9373-cb3856ee85c3" ulx="42" uly="787" lrx="470" lry="821" /><zone xml:id="m-8b19033e-8c3f-4e46-afe8-6dafd0bdf82b" ulx="476" uly="813" lrx="900" lry="853" /><zone xml:id="m-14af1170-61c6-477d-82f9-c60c0c36409e" ulx="39" uly="818" lrx="468" lry="845" /><zone xml:id="m-96768270-9946-40f0-94f7-db679058444b" ulx="39" uly="840" lrx="606" lry="876" /><zone xml:id="m-7833e80f-b508-439f-b32c-720c37778798" ulx="377" uly="890" lrx="568" lry="924" /><zone xml:id="m-0d6533f8-4530-4a18-a6a0-7070a1bc9d2e" ulx="79" uly="922" lrx="903" lry="965" /><zone xml:id="m-cda204d6-395e-4edd-9696-a1f205ef44db" ulx="40" uly="955" lrx="468" lry="992" /><zone xml:id="m-1ffc8630-a9ee-435e-9f16-870ee799797d" ulx="476" uly="955" lrx="901" lry="986" /><zone xml:id="m-8346b6c8-565d-4455-92d3-7e98bbe51389" ulx="472" uly="982" lrx="903" lry="1017" /><zone xml:id="m-17925e4b-9002-4c72-99e3-3254ea30ac46" ulx="39" uly="986" lrx="467" lry="1013" /><zone xml:id="m-4fa7e6e0-4190-4e46-9c9b-c64baf82aac6" ulx="471" uly="1007" lrx="901" lry="1040" /><zone xml:id="m-fe9d7862-5a70-4003-9092-1abcd2fd8cdd" ulx="40" uly="1008" lrx="469" lry="1044" /><zone xml:id="m-e834aef3-af31-4191-8205-d888f1333dec" ulx="39" uly="1038" lrx="903" lry="1072" /><zone xml:id="m-c2f9db5d-7ffc-4121-8d5a-47c6162705ac" ulx="39" uly="1065" lrx="886" lry="1101" /><zone xml:id="m-5b43a67f-e5f5-4e0e-868f-87ca0ea2bbdd" ulx="70" uly="1113" lrx="873" lry="1152" /><zone xml:id="m-87f7d126-1557-4b5b-a720-16187362e9e9" ulx="428" uly="1161" lrx="524" lry="1200" /><zone xml:id="m-dfc9fadf-d546-4323-819f-d759ea76a8e2" ulx="83" uly="1200" lrx="905" lry="1233" /><zone xml:id="m-63debbd7-21b3-4d03-a98b-3f7c2c54bde2" ulx="47" uly="1227" lrx="901" lry="1261" /><zone xml:id="m-cd0b525a-036a-41b7-bd7a-77ab7bc4a54f" ulx="40" uly="1258" lrx="904" lry="1293" /><zone xml:id="m-804b1da3-5606-4b3a-8051-ce84a7edc9da" ulx="39" uly="1280" lrx="901" lry="1320" /><zone xml:id="m-b0f315b3-6259-47c4-a089-1f377b59c70d" ulx="296" uly="1337" lrx="646" lry="1371" /><zone xml:id="m-7759c041-0917-4282-9aac-bb8c7fe29a73" ulx="428" uly="1382" lrx="525" lry="1417" /><zone xml:id="m-afb0aac2-8a17-4d06-957c-861568a0cfa0" ulx="82" uly="1426" lrx="905" lry="1463" /><zone xml:id="m-8e1572a0-179c-4289-ab5b-f42f2456a10c" ulx="45" uly="1451" lrx="903" lry="1489" /><zone xml:id="m-21e52014-bf35-47fb-b154-40987c1a9182" ulx="475" uly="1479" lrx="905" lry="1512" /><zone xml:id="m-9305a9b2-fb5f-4b88-9344-d7ca80103dc4" ulx="41" uly="1481" lrx="466" lry="1513" /><zone xml:id="m-e927e6be-f04d-49a9-a87c-4600c5679353" ulx="40" uly="1506" lrx="896" lry="1548" /></surface></facsimile><body>
    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-25087b02-debf-4e22-83db-f98d3fc44b61" n="2023" facs="#m-bada7933-cbab-4c73-9ca5-b128731f7504" /><div xml:id="m-c0ebc1cc-77bc-4f1a-9948-8b750d361582">
            <lg xml:id="m-fefaa091-cff0-4019-97cb-71a583c51ed3">
              <l xml:id="m-fec9b170-ae62-4ad3-9504-09696a0e9d19" facs="#m-5bf58136-0165-4e03-99ba-2b12e14b623a" label="text-like">At Vespers.</l><l xml:id="m-3973ceaf-a738-4fec-bc02-81a693166654" facs="#m-796114dc-9c6e-4ac8-a803-87498072f66b" label="ambiguous">1777</l><l xml:id="m-c89b667a-1fe0-493f-a3a3-36248054b3ff" facs="#m-d9f90d0f-9c3b-473d-b5cc-3dd3c9bfaaf7" label="lyrics-like">8. Dóminus custódit ádvenas, t pupillum et viduam suscipiet :* et</l><l xml:id="m-7fe6407b-4fb6-4036-9d57-8bd46711106b" facs="#m-112acacc-1408-421b-adce-84a55dcdf488" label="lyrics-like">vías peccatórum dispérdet.</l><l xml:id="m-110ad36c-444b-4dba-b2ec-4ec59fec39c1" facs="#m-9d32e9ae-ab69-4e92-aad4-32dc4e5407bb" label="lyrics-like">9° Regnábit Dóminus in saécula, Déus táus Sion, * in generatiónem</l><l xml:id="m-671d8f50-92cf-40be-90f9-cb4b3dd6f226" facs="#m-89f51f15-a0f1-4fe3-8fc7-c59c5269c4aa" label="lyrics-like">et generatiónem.</l><l xml:id="m-3aa43e72-b281-485b-80c0-82cba7e828f2" facs="#m-be849984-f49b-4a80-99ad-dee72769898d" label="lyrics-like">10. Réquiem aetérnam* dóna éis, Dómine.</l><l xml:id="m-e026a236-8a39-4eb7-bafd-0c14308398b9" facs="#m-3944c029-fa5e-4e72-a602-9343217825c0" label="lyrics-like">11. Et iux perpétua * lúceat éis.</l><l xml:id="m-29fd1c37-2456-4e99-8f9f-a81e54064fb4" facs="#m-2764f65d-94e7-4ffa-9f54-906ae68076b1" label="ambiguous">Then:</l><l xml:id="m-a823a47e-9c13-4ae4-aedd-57e7508ddcf3" facs="#m-6c7f3594-c855-42b1-8c8c-f790a212986f" label="lyrics-like">V. A pórta inferi. B. Erue Dómine ánimam éjus [ánimas eóruml.</l><l xml:id="m-eb68393a-11fb-437e-acc5-5f8a4d56c9a1" facs="#m-b863fa6f-b85e-4e5f-91f6-c242142c56ba" label="lyrics-like">V. Requiéscat in páce [Requiéscant in pácel. B. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-b8e0e82f-bb96-497b-8227-eaf29073899f" facs="#m-05e63541-fc98-4f58-9b71-dde81b852ca5" label="lyrics-like">V. Dómine exáudi oratiónem méam. B. Et clámor méus ad te véniat.</l><l xml:id="m-b378f39b-798f-40ef-b43e-13d6db9ebcd8" facs="#m-5ae14ab9-15eb-4d78-9caa-00b41ca21c93" label="lyrics-like">Y. Dóminus vobiscum. B. Et cum spiritu túo.</l><l xml:id="m-5749dbd1-4f05-49ab-bcb0-9946b3518132" facs="#m-c107a061-69c1-410e-a02b-6450a403ea70" label="lyrics-like">Orémus.</l><l xml:id="m-e284430b-544a-42eb-b455-5fe65d9538ba" facs="#m-baa775b2-6e82-4b4b-9f38-974536b585a5" label="text-like">The Prayer varies according to circumstances; it will be found among the</l><l xml:id="m-ef30d98a-6711-40e5-8669-ff4ad617c5ef" facs="#m-6812f752-53fa-4a6c-9287-089a756afe84" label="lyrics-like">following. The V. Réquiem aetérnam is then said and the Omce ends ãs on</l><l xml:id="m-d764ac7f-65f1-413e-b24a-8af8962ee165" facs="#m-76bd3842-1f78-43f4-ad4e-5abc7aa0b36c" label="ambiguous">P. 1779.</l><l xml:id="m-6fcd2270-df41-451d-a74a-ce79f5abf1b4" facs="#m-2e372973-0b8a-4d2d-adda-e2f0bda5f8c6" label="text-like">on the day of burial.</l><l xml:id="m-626a64cd-4db3-4c9c-84b5-a35d498da029" facs="#m-c607485d-511e-4f91-863b-6ac7ea4fd428" label="text-like">Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-134e05ce-f417-4956-9937-081e19b07318" facs="#m-423103a9-c6bd-4eb2-9ae9-95de07a1941f" label="lyrics-like">I Bsólve, quaésumus Dómine, áni-l pietátis abstérge. Per Dóminum no¬</l><l xml:id="m-09067b27-299c-4eb3-af82-6d4af82b2af8" facs="#m-a43131f9-65ea-4fb2-bf80-b50f3bb0eb0c" label="lyrics-like">A mam fámuli tui N., (fámulae strum Jesum Christum Filium</l><l xml:id="m-95e3c8c3-5711-4394-9741-6e773e749ab2" facs="#m-0f8482fc-e7f7-482b-8825-702f67a66bf5" label="lyrics-like">tuae N.)ut defúnctus (a) saéculo tibi</l><l xml:id="m-d2e4cf4f-f876-4aa5-80fc-16fbe1c6adb4" facs="#m-1ea0afa6-adca-486d-9c0d-ba6cd8d03f0a" label="ambiguous">tuum : f qui tecum vivit et regnat</l><l xml:id="m-7f6ccb9e-dd98-43fe-b7b4-0f5183b30c25" facs="#m-654bd452-01a8-427b-bdf5-98d067997e93" label="lyrics-like">in unitáte Spiritus Sancti Deus,»</l><l xml:id="m-9b573b57-10ad-487f-918d-17972a5469b8" facs="#m-d5be4e6e-337b-449a-9373-cb3856ee85c3" label="lyrics-like">vivat : t et quae per fragilitátem</l><l xml:id="m-ad52e635-f79d-4f80-b904-58f9f74ff7aa" facs="#m-8b19033e-8c3f-4e46-afe8-6dafd0bdf82b" label="lyrics-like">per ómnia saécula saeculórum.</l><l xml:id="m-24065c0d-d25c-419e-a75f-708cf8d3ebee" facs="#m-14af1170-61c6-477d-82f9-c60c0c36409e" label="lyrics-like">carnis humána conversatióne com¬</l><l xml:id="m-66738ccc-eff8-4fe6-99ea-7ac22dae5e85" facs="#m-96768270-9946-40f0-94f7-db679058444b" label="lyrics-like">mísit, tu * vénia misericordissimae! W. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-6c658f5f-aba1-4ebc-9e37-95f314c591b1" facs="#m-7833e80f-b508-439f-b32c-720c37778798" label="text-like">Another Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-60b9ea70-70b9-4e84-98ed-afe608b9a363" facs="#m-0d6533f8-4530-4a18-a6a0-7070a1bc9d2e" label="lyrics-like">Eus, cui próprium est miseréri neque obliviscáris in finem, sed jú¬</l><l xml:id="m-1d2e0f72-6fde-436c-aa24-c99753d7dd8f" facs="#m-cda204d6-395e-4edd-9696-a1f205ef44db" label="lyrics-like">U semper et párcere, te súpplices</l><l xml:id="m-0072fce8-3062-43a4-ad25-f0c722058232" facs="#m-1ffc8630-a9ee-435e-9f16-870ee799797d" label="lyrics-like">beas eam a sanctis Angelis súscipi,</l><l xml:id="m-de22c126-7d3a-4f8a-8e0d-14c43e66a0e5" facs="#m-8346b6c8-565d-4455-92d3-7e98bbe51389" label="lyrics-like">et ad pátriam paradísi perdúci; *ut</l><l xml:id="m-e0ca70b7-6f64-4b2d-aa2f-b1b61d797444" facs="#m-17925e4b-9002-4c72-99e3-3254ea30ac46" label="lyrics-like">exorámus pro ánima fámuli tui N.</l><l xml:id="m-ada4b528-6d73-4457-8210-cab3cfc9ed96" facs="#m-4fa7e6e0-4190-4e46-9c9b-c64baf82aac6" label="lyrics-like">quia in te sperávit et crédidit, non</l><l xml:id="m-aeba488f-189c-4cb9-9065-3a06389befa5" facs="#m-fe9d7862-5a70-4003-9092-1abcd2fd8cdd" label="lyrics-like">(fámulae tuae N.) quam hódie de</l><l xml:id="m-beacbd72-0606-41cd-8c9c-b2b317c32b47" facs="#m-e834aef3-af31-4191-8205-d888f1333dec" label="lyrics-like">hoc saéculo migráre jussísti : t ut poenas inférni sustineat, sed gáudia</l><l xml:id="m-ff2ae125-20a4-4ddb-a538-e557d1f1ef5a" facs="#m-c2f9db5d-7ffc-4121-8d5a-47c6162705ac" label="lyrics-like">non tradas eam in manus inimíci, ] aetérna possideat. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-2498f54b-f9d8-44a6-8cce-be978984ff9f" facs="#m-5b43a67f-e5f5-4e0e-868f-87ca0ea2bbdd" label="text-like">on the third, seventh, and thirtieth days aiter the death.</l><l xml:id="m-bdb59cbd-2ff1-4dcd-afa9-5dd9a843f347" facs="#m-87f7d126-1557-4b5b-a720-16187362e9e9" label="text-like">Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-f394c87c-5197-48cf-9760-5fa5e490d562" facs="#m-dfc9fadf-d546-4323-819f-d759ea76a8e2" label="lyrics-like">Uaésumus Dómine, ut ánimae morámus, fSanctórum atque electó¬</l><l xml:id="m-7cdd9e2f-dba4-4b77-b229-b2d453d18a1d" facs="#m-63debbd7-21b3-4d03-a98b-3f7c2c54bde2" label="lyrics-like">U fámuli tui N. (fámulae tuae N.) ] rum tuórum largíri dignéris consór¬</l><l xml:id="m-ae74456d-83d8-4906-b56e-4bb84939b168" facs="#m-cd0b525a-036a-41b7-bd7a-77ab7bc4a54f" label="lyrics-like">cujus depositiónis diem tértium (or l tium ; * et rorem misericórdiae tuae</l><l xml:id="m-d11c9387-e4d7-447f-a2a8-bb9b202289d9" facs="#m-804b1da3-5606-4b3a-8051-ce84a7edc9da" label="lyrics-like">séptimum, or trigésimum), comme- perénnem infúndas. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-9cbbf1b8-a2a9-40c9-9644-a0b410ee03be" facs="#m-b0f315b3-6259-47c4-a089-1f377b59c70d" label="text-like">on the anniversary day.</l><l xml:id="m-3e79a023-1d93-47f9-8f92-889205e35155" facs="#m-7759c041-0917-4282-9aac-bb8c7fe29a73" label="text-like">Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-204dd6fd-75ad-484e-841a-b0d0a7829348" facs="#m-afb0aac2-8a17-4d06-957c-861568a0cfa0" label="lyrics-like">Eus indulgentiárum Dómine: tl (quorum) anniversárium depositió¬</l><l xml:id="m-1f62f6c2-5239-489d-b006-642ebfb5653a" facs="#m-8e1572a0-179c-4289-ab5b-f42f2456a10c" label="lyrics-like">Uda ánimae fámuli tui N. (fámu-l nis diem commemorámus, 4 refrigé¬</l><l xml:id="m-d76fb638-036f-47f0-9438-b68928f104b5" facs="#m-21e52014-bf35-47fb-b154-40987c1a9182" label="lyrics-like">ri sedem, quiétis beatitúdinem, et</l><l xml:id="m-66a8869b-0eca-4ae8-8444-e4f523bcec0c" facs="#m-9305a9b2-fb5f-4b88-9344-d7ca80103dc4" label="lyrics-like">lae tuae N. or animábus famuló¬</l><l xml:id="m-bc105ce5-b02c-4f28-8d75-8aa02dba2556" facs="#m-e927e6be-f04d-49a9-a87c-4600c5679353" label="lyrics-like">rum famularúmque tuárum), cujus! lúminis claritâtem. Per Dóminum.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>